[gd_scene load_steps=23 format=3]

; The field: one 12 x 7.5 m sheet of paper lying flat on a desk, no rotation,
; so its footprint is the rectangle abs(x) <= 6, abs(z) <= 3.75 that
; JamoMonster / SpawnManager arena_half_extents (6, 3.75) describe. The
; 문장핵 sits at the rear centre (game_world.tscn), spawn points along the
; front and both sides. Doc v0.4 section 39. Resize PaperTop / SlabBody /
; Ground / Walls together and update the two arena_half_extents exports.

