; Desk dressing, doc v0.4 section 39. Each slot is a swap point: the finished
; asset goes into Decor's `replacements` under the slot name and the primitive
; stand-in below it is dropped at load (scripts/world/arena_decor.gd). Slots
; sit on the desk top (y = -0.6) outside the sheet.
